{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/07/6464973/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中のMdN連載のお相手は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青木むすびさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなH.P.DECOでの撮影(´* >*｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとお話を聞きたかった方！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多方面で幅広く活動されています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が主に惹かれるのは、バイヤー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔から憧れてた宝石箱みたいなお店は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むすびさんが買い付けてきたものばかり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今いちばんやりたいこととなった時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え！そこなんだ？！みたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突拍子もない感じ、素敵だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多趣味で飽き性であることは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にとってプラスなのかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ冒険できる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/07/6464973/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところで、連載なんと1ページ増です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月号から？になりそうです（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真も文もうきうきうきうき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神社も素敵、うきうき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日次号の取材しましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未だかつてない対談となりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/07/6464973/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花だよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日経エンタテインメント！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初森ベマーズのプロデューサーの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"濱谷さんから嬉しいお言葉を頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年がんばります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬休み、さゆ家のこたつで鍋会して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのまま泊りしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆが帰ってくる前に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お先におじゃまして日芽香と鍋を作って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅いけど誕生日ケーキの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サプライズしたりした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買い出しから楽しかったわね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、ほぼ寝なかった、最高∠( 'ω')／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/07/6464973/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/07/6464973/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社おみくじ、中吉だった∠( 'ω')／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}